Something's annoying me.

2264
02:22:30,570 --> 02:22:30,970
Hello?

2265
02:22:31,890 --> 02:22:33,030
Is it the flowers?

2266
02:22:36,960 --> 02:22:38,160
Fuck you, fuck you.

2267
02:22:45,150 --> 02:22:46,070
Oh, my God.

2268
02:22:47,770 --> 02:22:49,230
What's up with all these life crystals here?

2269
