It's very uninteresting.

2340
02:27:01,720 --> 02:27:02,180
Gotcha.

2341
02:27:02,620 --> 02:27:03,440
That goes in the trash.

2342
02:27:05,180 --> 02:27:06,360
Now, we do have an interesting chest.

2343
02:27:10,740 --> 02:27:11,100
No.

2344
02:27:11,660 --> 02:27:12,160
There we go.

2345
02:27:12,680 --> 02:27:14,500
And this chest is not interesting, so it gets deleted.

2346
02:27:15,180 --> 02:27:15,920
The rich mahogany?

2347
02:27:16,900 --> 02:27:17,160
Fuck off.

2348
02:27:17,160 --> 02:27:18,200
Don't want it.

2349
02:27:19,740 --> 02:27:20,240
Miscellaneous.

2350
02:27:21,260 --> 02:27:21,660
My favorite.

2351
02:27:23,100 --> 02:27:25,100
Let's put in that key.

2352
02:27:25,940 --> 02:27:27,340
The ornate shadow key.

2353
02:27:28,960 --> 02:27:29,460
Actually, no.

2354
02:27:29,720 --> 02:27:30,480
Put it down here instead.

2355
02:27:30,740 --> 02:27:31,400
It's an accessory.

2356
02:27:32,820 --> 02:27:33,280
In a way.

2357
02:27:34,700 --> 02:27:35,460
But then not really.

2358
02:27:37,300 --> 02:27:38,340
I mean, it's a curse.

2359
02:27:41,380 --> 02:27:42,420
Delete alert.

2360
02:27:50,840 --> 02:27:56,260
That could actually not be too bad with what I'm using right now.

2361
02:27:57,100 --> 02:27:57,360
You know?

2362
02:27:58,160 --> 02:27:59,220
I'm using this a lot.

2363
02:28:00,100 --> 02:28:01,400
The masterful magic missile.

2364
02:28:03,960 --> 02:28:05,320
That could be pretty dope.

2365
02:28:05,680 --> 02:28:06,660
Let me bring that.

2366
02:28:10,140 --> 02:28:12,260
Instead of that, let's put that there.

2367
02:28:15,220 --> 02:28:17,280
Oh, I need to bring mana potions then, of course.

2368
02:28:20,100 --> 02:28:20,520
Potions.

2369
02:28:24,120 --> 02:28:24,540
Mana.

2370
02:28:24,940 --> 02:28:26,740
So I have only these.

2371
02:28:26,920 --> 02:28:28,260
I don't know if I can make better ones.

2372
02:28:29,300 --> 02:28:30,540
But that'll have to do for now.

2373
02:28:31,860 --> 02:28:32,160
Drink that.

2374
02:28:34,100 --> 02:28:35,500
Yeah, I think we're good.

2375
02:28:36,040 --> 02:28:36,680
How do we get back?

2376
02:28:38,760 --> 02:28:39,600
Oh, shit.

2377
02:28:41,140 --> 02:28:42,240
How are we getting back?

2378
02:28:44,760 --> 02:28:48,660
I guess we go down from here and just connect it from upstairs.

2379
02:28:48,660 --> 02:28:51,720
And then on the way there, I think I want to try and fish a little bit.

2380
02:28:52,720 --> 02:28:55,820
I'm going to bring my upgraded and improved fishing rod that I bought.

2381
02:28:57,860 --> 02:28:59,360
I want to play with that.

2382
02:29:00,520 --> 02:29:01,200
This one.

2383
02:29:02,400 --> 02:29:03,140
Very cool.

2384
02:29:06,300 --> 02:29:07,960
And this one right here.

2385
02:29:08,600 --> 02:29:08,740
Nah.

2386
02:29:09,280 --> 02:29:10,060
Keep it here for now.

2387
02:29:11,160 --> 02:29:13,680
I'm not an amazing fan of that.

2388
02:29:14,740 --> 02:29:15,360
It's cool.

2389
02:29:16,320 --> 02:29:17,420
But is it really that cool?

2390
02:29:17,420 --> 02:29:18,240
That's the question.

2391
02:29:20,660 --> 02:29:21,700
Then I want to bring bait.

2392
02:29:25,620 --> 02:29:26,800
What bait do I want to bring?

2393
02:29:28,020 --> 02:29:28,660
Master bait?

2394
02:29:28,760 --> 02:29:28,940
Maybe.

2395
02:29:33,600 --> 02:29:35,900
Just bring a bit of whatever.

2396
02:29:36,920 --> 02:29:37,300
Yeah.

2397
02:29:38,080 --> 02:29:38,820
Let's do it.

2398
02:29:39,340 --> 02:29:39,860
Let's go.

2399
02:29:40,820 --> 02:29:41,660
We're off again.

2400
02:29:44,020 --> 02:29:44,540
See ya, people.

2401
02:29:47,100 --> 02:29:49,000
Look how fast I traversed the area now.

2402
02:29:56,170 --> 02:29:57,030
Let's fish here a bit.

2403
02:29:57,030 --> 02:29:58,370
Oh, look how cool that looks.

2404
02:29:59,110 --> 02:30:00,870
It's all mechanical and shit.

2405
02:30:03,250 --> 02:30:04,810
And I'm using purple bait.

2406
02:30:06,150 --> 02:30:06,730
Water strider.

2407
02:30:08,810 --> 02:30:09,630
That's probably bait.

2408
02:30:12,510 --> 02:30:12,630
Oops.

2409
02:30:13,490 --> 02:30:14,010
Flounder.

2410
02:30:16,350 --> 02:30:17,330
We can do better than that.

2411
02:30:18,010 --> 02:30:18,710
35% fishing power.

2412
02:30:20,510 --> 02:30:22,770
I guess I'm only using 15% bait power.

2413
02:30:23,710 --> 02:30:24,990
I should be masturbating here.

2414
02:30:25,710 --> 02:30:27,490
That's how you get the most out of it.

2415
02:30:30,490 --> 02:30:31,230
Come on.

2416
02:30:33,150 --> 02:30:34,410
Dude, this is taking forever.

2417
02:30:38,330 --> 02:30:39,830
Hey, it was worth it, though.

2418
02:30:42,090 --> 02:30:43,370
Nothing in it?

2419
02:30:45,470 --> 02:30:46,430
Oh, is it because of this?

2420
02:30:48,030 --> 02:30:48,230
Oh.

2421
02:30:49,910 --> 02:30:50,710
Awarding acolyte.

2422
02:30:52,210 --> 02:30:52,310
Oops.

2423
02:30:52,690 --> 02:30:53,490
Oh, I had to right click.

2424
02:30:54,110 --> 02:30:54,470
What is that?

2425
02:30:55,670 --> 02:30:56,990
Increase movement speed plus four defense?

2426
02:30:57,370 --> 02:30:57,730
Huh.

2427
02:30:58,710 --> 02:30:59,230
You know what?

2428
02:30:59,230 --> 02:31:01,030
Let's equip that for a while, since we gotta be traveling.

2429
02:31:05,600 --> 02:31:05,760
Hey.

2430
02:31:07,420 --> 02:31:09,080
Look at my cute turtle, though.

2431
02:31:10,520 --> 02:31:11,480
Did I bring my net?

2432
02:31:12,200 --> 02:31:12,540
I didn't.

2433
02:31:12,680 --> 02:31:13,220
So you get to die.

2434
02:31:14,660 --> 02:31:15,560
Oh, something else died.

2435
02:31:17,200 --> 02:31:17,740
That's fine.

2436
02:31:19,380 --> 02:31:20,720
By the way, notice how there's no enemies.

2437
02:31:21,100 --> 02:31:21,640
Isn't this great?

2438
02:31:21,800 --> 02:31:22,720
We get to fish in peace.

2439
02:31:27,220 --> 02:31:28,700
I wonder what happened to the old man.

2440
02:31:29,800 --> 02:31:32,400
At the entrance to the underground place we went to.

2441
02:31:34,160 --> 02:31:37,400
The guy I fought, Skeletron, he was obviously his master, right?

2442
02:31:38,060 --> 02:31:40,020
He said, my master will not fight you, whatever.

2443
02:31:41,620 --> 02:31:44,400
So I wonder where the old man went.

2444
02:31:45,260 --> 02:31:46,460
Whether or not I get to see him again.

2445
02:31:47,900 --> 02:31:48,800
An extractinator.

2446
02:31:50,300 --> 02:31:50,640
Wow.

2447
02:31:51,340 --> 02:31:53,980
I fished that up from this here lake.

2448
02:31:55,620 --> 02:31:55,960
Incredible.

2449
02:31:59,000 --> 02:32:00,820
I must have some muscles on me.

2450
02:32:07,500 --> 02:32:11,940
I should have brought the damn potion that gave me a chance of finding boxes.

2451
02:32:17,580 --> 02:32:19,060
What bait am I using right now?

2452
02:32:29,260 --> 02:32:29,360
Wait.

2453
02:32:31,080 --> 02:32:32,260
Oh, I'm using this one.

2454
02:32:32,700 --> 02:32:34,320
You can actually see it on the cursor here.

2455
02:32:39,660 --> 02:32:39,960
Thank you.

2456
02:32:40,220 --> 02:32:40,500
Oyster!

2457
02:32:43,280 --> 02:32:44,220
Shocked oyster.

2458
02:32:45,240 --> 02:32:45,840
I'll eat that.

2459
02:32:46,740 --> 02:32:47,240
Mmm, delicious.

2460
02:32:48,160 --> 02:32:49,300
Raw and wriggling.

2461
02:32:54,340 --> 02:32:56,880
I kind of want to just fish a lot in every biome.

2462
02:32:57,040 --> 02:32:58,420
See what I can get.

2463
02:32:59,740 --> 02:33:03,260
And also fish down in the caves, if I find a nice pool of water.

2464
02:33:13,140 --> 02:33:14,360
It almost looks like I have wings.

2465
02:33:17,710 --> 02:33:18,370
I'm flying.

2466
02:33:22,450 --> 02:33:23,590
I love this turtle.

2467
02:33:23,710 --> 02:33:24,930
This is my favorite so far.

2468
02:33:26,310 --> 02:33:26,950
A tin can.

2469
02:33:27,890 --> 02:33:29,210
Not quite a robust can.

2470
02:33:29,950 --> 02:33:30,450
Just a tin.

2471
02:33:36,420 --> 02:33:38,000
So many flounders, what the hell?

2472
02:33:43,460 --> 02:33:44,740
More crates, more crates.

2473
02:33:46,240 --> 02:33:46,560
Hey!

2474
02:33:49,240 --> 02:33:52,160
A hundred potion and a lazy falcon blade.

2475
02:33:53,380 --> 02:33:54,840
Ah, shit, that was a bit too early there.

2476
02:33:57,100 --> 02:33:57,500
Cool.

2477
02:34:07,810 --> 02:34:08,990
Ah, man, this is so relaxing.

2478
02:34:09,210 --> 02:34:10,070
I can play with one hand.

2479
02:34:10,150 --> 02:34:14,530
I can just sit here and sip my coffee while I find iron boxes.

2480
02:34:15,390 --> 02:34:15,790
Oh!

2481
02:34:15,790 --> 02:34:16,370
It broke.

2482
02:34:17,290 --> 02:34:20,650
We're using a butterfly now.

2483
02:34:24,280 --> 02:34:25,480
And now we're using nothing.

2484
02:34:26,540 --> 02:34:26,960
So rip.

2485
02:34:28,840 --> 02:34:30,960
And I can't catch these because I didn't bring my net.

2486
02:34:32,120 --> 02:34:32,340
Frick.

2487
02:34:36,180 --> 02:34:36,600
Damn it.

2488
02:34:37,740 --> 02:34:38,380
Ah, you know what?

2489
02:34:39,500 --> 02:34:40,200
Ah, man.

2490
02:34:41,080 --> 02:34:41,840
Let me quickly go back.

2491
02:34:43,360 --> 02:34:44,540
I gotta bring my bait.

2492
02:34:46,040 --> 02:34:47,200
I gotta bring that bait.

2493
02:34:48,520 --> 02:34:49,340
Gotta bring the bait.

2494
02:34:51,340 --> 02:34:52,420
Should've brought more, huh?

2495
02:34:53,460 --> 02:34:54,960
I wanna go fish somewhere else now.

2496
02:34:56,100 --> 02:34:56,120
Fishing!

2497
02:34:56,680 --> 02:34:57,400
No, fishing.

2498
02:34:58,460 --> 02:35:01,040
Give me the master bait.

2499
02:35:02,080 --> 02:35:05,820
And also, give me enchanted nightcrawlers.

2500
02:35:08,720 --> 02:35:10,140
Actually, give me these instead.

2501
02:35:10,520 --> 02:35:10,760
Yeah, yeah.

2502
02:35:11,560 --> 02:35:12,920
Give me all of them.

2503
02:35:23,920 --> 02:35:27,760
I feel that I run faster right now, just a little bit.

2504
02:35:30,060 --> 02:35:30,820
Maybe it's a placebo.

2505
02:35:34,010 --> 02:35:34,230
Whoops.

2506
02:35:37,980 --> 02:35:39,640
I am flying through this world.

2507
02:35:43,260 --> 02:35:44,280
Look at that.

2508
02:35:45,280 --> 02:35:45,880
No problem.

2509
02:35:46,260 --> 02:35:48,720
While I'm running, casually killing people.

2510
02:35:53,290 --> 02:35:55,650
The progression is really nice in this game.

2511
02:35:55,790 --> 02:35:56,730
It feels good.

2512
02:36:00,300 --> 02:36:01,140
Like, look at that shit.

2513
02:36:01,920 --> 02:36:07,140
Compare this to the beginning, where I was shooting my sword.

2514
02:36:09,500 --> 02:36:13,300
That's just the funniest animation.

2515
02:36:15,960 --> 02:36:16,500
Where am I going?

2516
02:36:17,560 --> 02:36:18,300
All the way over there.

2517
02:36:19,120 --> 02:36:20,480
Dope, dope.

2518
02:36:25,190 --> 02:36:26,110
Here.

2519
02:36:30,660 --> 02:36:31,760
Let's see it.

2520
02:36:33,660 --> 02:36:35,500
